  summary "The bounty of the Thaw dwindles as colonies multiply beyond what the waters can sustain. Trade routes become battle lines; old alliances fracture along cultural fault lines between the shadow-brokers of the Nightfall Shelf and the mystics of the Aurora Stack. Factions emerge within colonies, each claiming the true path to survival. Heroes rise not from exploration but from war, their names etched in the ice memorials that dot every berg. Along the outer currents, orca raiding parties grow bolder — isolated fishing crews vanish, and border colonies report strange songs echoing from the deep."
